# Enforce LF line endings on all text files for cross-platform hash consistency.
# The cache-busting script (fix-cache-busting.mjs) computes MD5 hashes on raw
# file bytes. If Windows dev machines write CRLF while CI uses LF, the hashes
# diverge and every HTML file shows as changed on every commit — making the
# hash stamps unreliable. This file ensures the committed blob is always LF.
*               text=auto

# Binary assets — never modified by the clean filter
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.svg  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
